From: Stained Glass OS <dev@stained-glass.example>
Subject: wintypes: ApiInformation answers member and type queries -- Signal Desktop starts

Windows.Foundation.Metadata.ApiInformation's IsTypePresent, IsMethodPresent
(with and without arity), IsEventPresent, IsPropertyPresent (read-only and
writeable), IsEnumNamedValuePresent and IsApiContractPresentByMajorAndMinor
returned E_NOTIMPL. C++/WinRT turns that into an exception: Signal
Desktop's notification module asks IsPropertyPresent("...ToastNotification",
"ExpiresOnReboot") while it loads, the exception left the Node module's
initialization, and the main process stopped with "A JavaScript error
occurred in the main process".

Each now answers. A type is present when it is an API contract we provide or
a runtime class registered as activatable; there is no metadata (.winmd) to
look members up in, so members are reported not present, and callers take
their fallback paths. A contract is present at minor version 0 of its
highest major version.

Written from the documented API. Gate: test/winrtstreams-gate.sh.
Known follow-up: dlls/wintypes/tests marks several of these todo_wine;
the ones that now pass (S_OK and FALSE for a NULL member name) need their
todo_wine removed before the tests are run.
---
--- a/dlls/wintypes/main.c
+++ b/dlls/wintypes/main.c
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@
 #include "winstring.h"
 #include "wine/debug.h"
 #include "objbase.h"
+#include "winreg.h"
 
 #include "activation.h"
 #include "rometadataresolution.h"
@@ -57,6 +58,27 @@
     return FALSE;
 }
 
+/* A type is known to be present when it is an API contract we provide or a
+ * runtime class registered as activatable. There is no metadata (.winmd) to
+ * look members up in, so a member is reported present only if it is one
+ * the caller can be certain of: none. Answering "not present" makes callers
+ * take their fallback paths instead of failing. */
+static BOOLEAN is_type_present( const HSTRING hname )
+{
+    const WCHAR *name = WindowsGetStringRawBuffer( hname, NULL );
+    WCHAR path[512];
+    unsigned int i;
+    HKEY key;
+
+    for (i = 0; i < ARRAY_SIZE(present_contracts); ++i)
+        if (!wcsicmp( name, present_contracts[i].name )) return TRUE;
+    if (!name[0] || wcslen( name ) > 400) return FALSE;
+    swprintf( path, ARRAY_SIZE(path), L"Software\\Microsoft\\WindowsRuntime\\ActivatableClassId\\%s", name );
+    if (RegOpenKeyExW( HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE, path, 0, KEY_READ, &key )) return FALSE;
+    RegCloseKey( key );
+    return TRUE;
+}
+
